      "writtenOn": "2025-07-15T13:31:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In the function description we can find that `elan_sensor_acquire_image_with_mode()` returns negative value on error, but there is not information if that negative value is compatible with Zephyr. I think it\u0027s okay to print elan return code in `LOG_ERR()` above and return something like `-EFAULT` here.",
